// The Go workspace for this repository.
//
// Why it is committed: contrib modules depend on the core, which is in the
// same repository and is not always tagged at the version they require. The
// alternative is a `replace` directive in each contrib go.mod, and that
// breaks `go install` and `go get` for everyone outside this checkout,
// because a replace in a dependency is ignored by consumers while the
// unresolvable require line is not. The workspace keeps local development
// working without putting anything in a published go.mod that a consumer
// cannot resolve.
//
// Adding a module means adding it here and to MODULES in Taskfile.yml.

go 1.25.0

use (
	.
	./contrib/debug
	./contrib/driver-mysql
	./contrib/driver-pgx
	./contrib/vet
	./contrib/driver-sqlite
	./contrib/migrate
	./contrib/structbind
)

// The pin in contrib/driver-sqlite/go.mod names the version a consumer will
// resolve from the proxy. Until that tag exists, resolving it here would hit
// the network and fail, so the workspace maps it to this checkout. A replace
// in go.work is local only: it is never published and a consumer never sees
// it, which is the whole reason it lives here and not in go.mod.
replace github.com/ubgo/sqlb v0.1.0 => .
